    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis detached split-level house is situated on the Bagenalstown to Kilkenny Road (R448), with approximately 221 square metres of living space on a spacious 0.9 acre site.\nThe property is approached by a driveway to the front door, with generous grounds to the front and the rear. Much of the rear garden is laid out as an orchard. \n\nThe main floor comprises an enclosed porch with sliding door,\nentrance hall, lounge, large kitchen/dining room, utility room,\nseparate toilet, four spacious bedrooms and a main bathroom.\n\nOne of the bedrooms has an en-suite and a walk-in wardrobe.\nThe lower level has four rooms, with one of the rooms having\nFrench doors out into the garden. These rooms could be used as a family or living area, children's playroom, home office, workshop or storage. The lower level could also have potential to provide separate living accommodation.\n\nThe house is approximately five minutes from Exit 6 at Paulstown on the M9. There is a direct road north to Dublin and south to Waterford. Bagenalstown railway station is a short drive away, with direct services to Dublin Heuston station, Carlow and Waterford.\n\nViewings by appointment with Sherry FitzGerald Mc Dermott"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nPorch - \nSliding door to paved front patio.\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.135 x 2.489\nPolished granite tiled floor. Alarm key pad.\n\nLounge - 5.766 x 4.583\nPolished hard wood floor. Stanley solid fuel stove. Blinds. Access door to Kitchen / Dining.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 7.377 x 3.679\nFitted wall and floor units. Tiled floor and splash back. Oven, extractor fan, hob, dishwasher, fridge freezer.\n\nUtility Room - 3.784 x 2.030\nTiled floor. Wall press unit. Door to rear patio. Stairs to lower floor.\n\nGuest W.C. - 1.52 x 0.938\nTiled floor. W.C.\n\nLanding - 8.072 x 0.869\nPolished hard wood floor. Stira stairs, partly floored attic. Airing press.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.432 x 3.670\nPolished hardwood floor. Blind. Wall mounted T.V. point.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.402 x 3.723\nPolished hard wood floor. Blind. Wall mounted T.V. point.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.399 x 3.939\nLaminate wooden flooring. Blind.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.618 x 3.912\nLaminate wooden flooring. Blind. Wall mounted T.V. point.\n\nWalk In Wardrobe - 2.345 x 1.646\nFitted floor units. Laminate wooden flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.805 x 2.477\nToilet, sink, bath, shower. Tiled floor and walls.\n\nLower Floor - \n\n\nRoom 1 - 4.365 x 5.933\nTiled floor. Double French glass doors.\n\nRoom 2 - 3.633 x 4.330\nTiled floor.\n\nRoom 3 - 3.054 x 2.989\nTiled floor. Under stairs press.\n\nRoom 4 - 2.357 x 1.771\nTiled floor.\n\n"
      },
